  "solution": {
    "text": "As we know the general solution of the equation<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>tan</mi><mi>α</mi><mtext> </mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext>is</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext>given</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext>by</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext> </mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>π</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>I</mi></math><br /><br />Hence the solution of the equation, <math> <mrow> <mtext>tan</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>k</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> <mi>θ</mi> <mo>=</mo> <mtext>tan</mtext> <mi>θ</mi> </mrow> </math><br /><br />is given by <math> <mrow> <mo></mo> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>k</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> <mi>θ</mi> <mo>=</mo> <mtext>n</mtext> <mi>π</mi> <mo>+</mo> <mi>θ</mi> <mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;⇒&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo> <mtext>k</mtext> <mi>θ</mi> <mo>=</mo> <mtext>n</mtext> <mi>π,&nbsp;</mi> </mrow></math><math><mrow><mtext>&nbsp;n</mtext> <mo>∈</mo> <mi>I</mi> </mrow></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∴</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>∈</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>π</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mfrac><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>∈</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>I</mi></math><span style=\"display: none;\">&nbsp;</span>"
